WEBVTT

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.809
- [screams]
- [Wolf grunting]

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:21.813
[old lady panting]

00:00:21.897 --> 00:00:23.981
[sighs] Here, let me help you.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.401
Are you okay, ma'am?

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:29.529
[panting] My gracious, yes.

00:00:29.613 --> 00:00:33.199
I may be dizzy, but I'm alive!
Thanks to you.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.325
What are you...

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.244
Oh. [moans]

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:37.745
[groans]

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.747
Thank you, dear.

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:43.876
You're such a good boy.

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:54.387
[grunts]

00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:04.981
All good, brother?

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:08.693
Yeah, all good. Yeah, yeah.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:09.944
Um... [babbling]

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.447
Webs, what do you say
about movin' on to step four?

00:01:12.531 --> 00:01:15.408
Copy that. Shark, you're up.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.617
Do your thing.

00:01:16.702 --> 00:01:18.536
<i>- Do I get to improvise?</i>
<i>- Yes, fine.</i>

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.872
Improvise. But please be subtle.

00:01:24.543 --> 00:01:27.003
I'm having a baby!

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.254
Is there a doctor?

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:32.633
Or perhaps several security guards
that could leave their post and help me?

00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:34.218
- [gasps]
- [elevator bell dings]

00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:36.012
[people clamoring]

00:01:52.488 --> 00:01:53.905
"Fish surprise"?

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:56.532
Surprise!

00:01:56.617 --> 00:01:58.910
- [shouts]
- [security guards grunting]

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:06.793
- [Wolf] Hey, Webs, can you enhance this...
- [Tarantula] Done.

00:02:06.877 --> 00:02:08.169
<i>Eight steps ahead of you, Wolfie.</i>

00:02:15.177 --> 00:02:17.011
- Ah.
<i>- -[announcer] Ladies and gentlemen,</i>

00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:20.223
<i>your MC for the Good Samaritan Awards...</i>

00:02:20.307 --> 00:02:21.307
[huffing]

00:02:21.391 --> 00:02:23.643
<i>[Wolf] All right, Shark, we're in.</i>

00:02:23.727 --> 00:02:25.478
Oops, I forgot. I'm not pregnant.

00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:30.399
<i>[announcer] ...president of the committee,</i>
<i>Governor Diane Foxington.</i>

00:02:30.484 --> 00:02:33.194
Thank you. Thank you.
Thank you so much.

00:02:33.278 --> 00:02:34.445
Thank you.

00:02:35.781 --> 00:02:38.616
Last year, we faced our biggest test

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:42.370
when a meteorite crashed
into our dear city.

00:02:42.454 --> 00:02:45.790
That meteorite didn't just make a hole
in our city,

00:02:45.874 --> 00:02:47.834
it made a hole in our hearts.

00:02:47.918 --> 00:02:48.918
[guests] Aw.

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:51.796
But even in tragedy, Professor Marmalade,

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.464
he did what he does so well.

00:02:53.549 --> 00:02:56.175
He made us look at things differently.

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:57.885
And thanks to you, Marmalade,

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:01.055
the Love Crater Meteorite
will forever serve

00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:02.932
as a symbol of how there is good,

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.476
even in the worst places.

00:03:05.561 --> 00:03:06.769
[guests applauding]

00:03:06.854 --> 00:03:08.271
Whoo!

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.399
[Piranha laughs, grunts]

00:03:18.323 --> 00:03:19.323
Hurry up.

00:03:20.993 --> 00:03:25.788
<i>And successfully reversed climate change</i>
<i>for the well-being of all of us.</i>

00:03:25.873 --> 00:03:28.749
This is going surprisingly smoothly.

00:03:37.426 --> 00:03:39.260
What the molt is that?

00:03:39.344 --> 00:03:42.430
The Wolf-Piranha-Snake-Shark-Tarantula
Protection System.

00:03:42.514 --> 00:03:44.807
- [Tarantula] The W.P.S.S. T.?
- This was not supposed to happen.

00:03:44.892 --> 00:03:47.852
- What?
- Guys, calm down. I'm on it.

00:03:47.936 --> 00:03:50.104
Initiating W.P.S.S.T. Override Protocol.

00:03:51.315 --> 00:03:52.648
Get it, queen!

00:03:54.026 --> 00:03:56.569
<i>- [Wolf] Did it work?</i>
- Just give me five minutes.

00:03:56.653 --> 00:03:57.612
[Diane] Andnow,

00:03:57.696 --> 00:03:59.906
please join me in welcoming to the stage...

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:01.616
We don't have five minutes.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.659
...Professor Marmalade!

00:04:03.744 --> 00:04:04.952
- Oh.
- [guests cheering]

00:04:05.037 --> 00:04:07.204
We love you,
Professor Marmalade!

00:04:07.289 --> 00:04:08.414
The pig is on the move.

00:04:08.498 --> 00:04:10.875
I repeat, the pig is on the move.

00:04:10.959 --> 00:04:11.959
<i>[Wolf] Webs, Webs!</i>

00:04:12.044 --> 00:04:14.587
- The curtain's going up any minute!
- It's not letting me in.

00:04:14.671 --> 00:04:17.381
- Check your system preferences.
- You probably need to download a driver.

00:04:17.466 --> 00:04:18.382
Try rebooting.

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:20.051
Oh, my gosh, you fixed it.

00:04:20.135 --> 00:04:21.802
- [Wolf, Snake] Really?
- No!

00:04:21.887 --> 00:04:22.929
[Chief] Hey, Larry.

00:04:23.639 --> 00:04:26.015
Come on, open up.
What did we say about lockin' doors?

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:28.476
No, no, no.
Shark, I got a situation here.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:29.810
<i>[Shark] Copy that. I'm on my way.</i>

00:04:29.895 --> 00:04:31.646
[stomach gurgling]

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:33.147
Hurry up, guys.

00:04:33.231 --> 00:04:35.274
Time to turn this baby on beast mode.

00:04:37.819 --> 00:04:39.362
Eat it, W.P.S.S.T.

00:04:44.368 --> 00:04:46.243
- [gurgling continues]
- Please, not now.

00:04:46.328 --> 00:04:47.995
- [Piranha] Wolf!
- Wait, wait, wait. No, Piranha!

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.580
- This award is for...
- [farts]

00:04:51.792 --> 00:04:53.834
[clears throat] As I was saying...

00:04:54.503 --> 00:04:56.879
No, no, no.

00:04:59.591 --> 00:05:01.217
[sniffs]

00:05:01.301 --> 00:05:03.094
Piranha! Are you kidding me?

00:05:03.178 --> 00:05:04.053
[Piranha] Sorry!

00:05:04.137 --> 00:05:06.347
And that's why
my Gala for Goodness

00:05:06.431 --> 00:05:09.225
will raise all the money needed
for those less fortunate.

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:10.476
- [Chief] Come on!
- [knocking]

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:11.727
[gasps]

00:05:12.479 --> 00:05:14.480
I'm starting to get mad here, Larry.

00:05:15.899 --> 00:05:16.983
<i>[Wolf] Webs! Webs!</i>

00:05:18.235 --> 00:05:20.820
And now,
the moment we've all been waiting for.

00:05:22.406 --> 00:05:23.531
- [Wolf gasps]
- Whoa!

